    "directions": [
      "In a mixing bowl, add grated potato, whole wheat flour, carom seeds, degi red chilli powder and mix well.",
      "Add salt to taste, oil and water knead a soft dough, cover and keep aside for 10 minutes.",
      "Now take a medium portion of the dough and roll it thin using a rolling pin.",
      "The half cook it on a hot flat pan from both sides and then cut in strips and then in triangle shape.",
      "Heat oil for deep frying and then fry these triangles in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy.",
      "Remove on an absorbent paper, then add the Nacho spice and mix it properly, then keep aside for further use.",
      "For Dip",
      "In a bowl, add hung curd whisk it properly.",
      "Heat oil in a tadka pan, add mustard seeds, chana dal, gota urad and fenugreek seeds let it splutter.",
      "Add Dry kashmiri chilli, ginger, curry leaves and mix well.",
      "Pour the tadka over the hung curd and mix well."
    ],
